---
import "@styles/global.module.css";
import Cursor from "@components/cursor.astro";
import Footer from "@components/footer.astro";
import Header from "@components/header.astro";
import Meta from "@components/meta.astro";
import Scripts from "@components/scripts.astro";
---

<html>
    <head>
        <Meta name="Services" description="Check out my list of self-hosted services, including Forgejo and Akkoma! :3" />
        <Scripts />
        <Cursor />
        <style>
            .error {
                background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgb(136, 0, 0) 20%, rgb(78, 0, 0) 50%, rgb(150, 1, 1) 100%);
                color: white;
                border: 2px solid red;
                padding: 10px;
            }
        </style>
    </head>

    <body>
        <canvas id="background"></canvas>
        <!-- God damnit, I'm forced to use inline styles because Astro is stupid -->
        <div style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;">
            <Header />
            <main>
                <h1>Self-hosted services</h1>

                <p>Here's what I run. Some are my projects, some are FOSS software hosted for myself (and friends).</p>

                <h2>Akabot: Discord Bot</h2>
                <p>I maintain and run my own Discord bot. More on that is available <a href="https://akabot.xyz">in its project page</a>.</p>
                <p>There are 2 versions of Akabot that are run on my server. One is the public version and the other is a more private version.</p>

                <h2>Forgejo: Git server</h2>
                <p>Here's where all my code (usually tested in production) is stored.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <a href="https://git.lunya.pet/lunya" target="_blank">My account on my Forgejo instance</a>
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <h2>Sharkey: The Fediverse</h2>
                <p>Sharkey is a silly federated microblogging platform which spend most of my time on and post on very frequently.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <a href="https://sk.lunya.pet/@lunya" target="_blank">View my profile on Sharkey</a>
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <p>Wanna join Sharkey? <a href="https://sharkey.fediverse.observer" target="_blank">Find yourself a Sharkey instance</a>. You can sign up on any instance, and you'll still be able to follow me.</p>

                <h3>GoToSocial: For bots</h3>
                <p>I run a few bots on the fediverse, and a fast instance is something that&apos;s very useful for this. In thec configuration, the cooldown can be disabled so I do not have to handle ratelimits.</p>

                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <a href="https://gts.lunya.pet/@collabmarkov" target="_blank"> - Collaborative Markov Bot&apos;s account page</a>. <a href="/project/collabmarkov">Also view the project page.</a>
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <p>More bots may be hosted on this instance, or on Sharkey if I need the reactions.</p>

                <h2>PHPBB: Forums</h2>
                <p>I run a forum as an alternative to Discord. Anyone can sign up and post.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="https://forums.lunya.pet" target="_blank">Open my forums</a></li>
                </ul>
            </main>
            <Footer />
        </div>
        <script is:inline defer src="/scripts/background.js"></script>
    </body>
</html>
